f3=A.cL(b3,b2,A.b(["Smart dashboard with digitized contact count, AI accuracy, and Pro scan credits","Point-and-capture camera with automatic edge detection and crop","AI field extraction for names, titles, phones, emails, and addresses","Local-first storage with optional Face ID / Fingerprint lock","Automatic cloud sync across devices","CRM-ready VCF and CSV exports (Salesforce, HubSpot, Excel)","Custom tags and search by name, company, title, or conference","Interactive contact directory with card image viewer","Native contacts sync and deep-link social launching"],f2),"Norvo digitizes physical business cards in seconds. Scan any card, let multimodal AI extract every detail with ~98% accuracy, then keep your network searchable, synced, and ready to follow up. Contacts stay private on-device with optional biometric lock, automatic cloud backup, CRM-ready VCF/CSV export, and tagging/search for conferences and investor lists.",b3,!0,!0,"Architected the hybrid feature/layer app structure, integrated Gemini OCR extraction pipelines, built the review/verification board with confidence highlighting, shipped the marketing site, and implemented native contacts sync, social deep links, and rich media sharing.",A.b([b4,"assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_2.webp","assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_3.webp","assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_4.webp","assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_5.webp","assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_6.webp","assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_7.webp","assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_8.webp","assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_9.webp","assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_10.webp","assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_11.webp","assets/project_mockup/norvo/screen_12.webp"],f2),"Never lose a valuable connection \u2014 AI business card scanner",f3,b4,"Norvo","https://norvo-pro.vercel.app/")
