n=A.cL("https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.anayon.user&pli=1",c1,A.b(["Map & charger discovery with clustering, search, and filters","Charging station details with connector info and pricing","QR scanner to start charging quickly",c2,"Auto Charge on charger connection","RFID card management","Wallet top-ups via Razorpay with invoice history","Multi-vehicle management and charging history","OTP/password authentication with guest mode","In-app support tickets, FAQ, and dark mode"],f2),"Anayon is a Flutter-based EV charging mobile app for Android and iOS. It helps drivers discover nearby chargers, start and monitor live charging sessions, manage vehicles and RFID cards, and handle wallet top-ups and invoices \u2014 with multi-role access for guests, employees, and corporate admins.","https://apps.apple.com/us/app/anayon/id6757525189",!1,!0,"Built end-to-end EV charging flows from map discovery through live sessions, integrated wallet payments and multi-role experiences, and delivered Android & iOS store releases with push notifications and remote config updates.",A.b([],f2),"EV charging app with map discovery, live sessions, and wallet payments",n,b6,"Anayon",b6)
