a1=A.cL(b6,"Real Estate",A.b(["Browse and search rental and purchase properties","Side-by-side property comparison","Book properties with token amount payment","Detailed property information with rich images","Favourite property saving and management","Book property visit appointments","Select time, date, and communication preferences","One-to-one chat with brokers","Call or message brokers directly","View broker profiles and related property details","Stripe Payment Gateway integration","Token-based booking payments","Secure and complete checkout flow","Hive-based local database","Offline data caching","Image compression and optimization","Camera and gallery image picking","Image cropping support","Cached network images","Camera, storage, and notification permission handling","File system access via path_provider","Dio API layer with interceptors","Offline detection support",d3,"URL launching for external links",d4,"Local notification support",d9,"Responsive layout for all screens","UI scaling with ScreenUtil & ResponsiveBuilder",d5,"Shimmer effects","Stylish loaders","Carousel sliders","SVG rendering","Custom Onest font family",d7,"Modular, scalable codebase",e0,e1,d6,"Code generation via build_runner","FlutterGen for assets"],f2),"A fully featured real estate application built with Flutter, enabling users to discover, compare, and book properties with ease. The app provides rich property listings, detailed information, high-quality images, and a seamless browsing experience. Users can save favourites, compare properties side-by-side, and pay token amounts using Stripe for secure booking. It supports appointment scheduling, one-to-one chat with brokers, and full broker contact options. Architected with Riverpod, GetIt + Injectable, Freezed, and powered by Dio networking, Hive local storage, Firebase messaging, responsive UI, and modern animations for a premium app-like experience.",b6,!0,!1,"Implemented full property browsing and comparison flows, booking and appointment system, Stripe payments, broker chat, Dio-based networking, offline caching with Hive, responsive UI, animations, and architectural setup using Riverpod, Injectable, and Freezed.",A.b([e2,"assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_2.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_3.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_4.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_5.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_6.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_7.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_8.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_9.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_10.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_11.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_12.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_13.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_14.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_15.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_16.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_17.webp","assets/project_mockup/realnest/screen_18.webp"],f2),"Modern real estate app with property search, comparison, booking, broker chat, and secure payments.",a1,e2,"RealNest \u2013 Property Search & Booking App",b6)
