a2=A.cL(b6,"Logistics",A.b(["Live Google Maps delivery tracking","Background location updates","Auto route drawing with polylines","Geocoding and place search","Map marker clustering","OTP verification","Pickup and delivery address selection","Profile photo upload","CSV and Excel file export",e3,"Offline mode support","API-based real-time delivery status updates","High-accuracy GPS","Background navigation updates","Dynamic route polylines","Razorpay payment integration",d5,"Staggered animations","Smooth loaders","Custom icons and fonts",d9,"Full responsive UI scaling",d7,e0,e1,"Local storage using Hive & SharedPreferences"],f2),"A complete delivery and order-tracking application built with Flutter, designed for real-time logistics operations. The app features live Google Maps tracking, background location updates, accurate route drawing, and geocoding-based address search. It supports OTP verification, pickup and delivery flows, profile management, file exports, and real-time delivery status via APIs. Integrated with Razorpay for payments, Firebase notifications, modern animations, and a fully responsive multilingual UI. Architected using Riverpod, GetIt + Injectable, Freezed models, and Hive/SharedPrefs for local storage.",b6,!1,!1,"Built real-time maps tracking with background updates, implemented routing and geocoding, added OTP and delivery flow, integrated Razorpay payments, developed responsive multilingual UI, structured architecture using Riverpod + Injectable + Freezed, and implemented notifications with offline support.",A.b([e4,"assets/project_mockup/trackdots/screen_2.webp","assets/project_mockup/trackdots/screen_3.webp","assets/project_mockup/trackdots/screen_4.webp","assets/project_mockup/trackdots/screen_5.webp","assets/project_mockup/trackdots/screen_6.webp","assets/project_mockup/trackdots/screen_7.webp","assets/project_mockup/trackdots/screen_8.webp","assets/project_mockup/trackdots/screen_9.webp","assets/project_mockup/trackdots/screen_10.webp","assets/project_mockup/trackdots/screen_11.webp"],f2),"Real-time delivery tracking app with live maps, route navigation, OTP, payments, and multi-language support.",a2,e4,"Trackdots \u2013 Real-Time Delivery & Order Tracking App",b6)
