a4=A.cL(b6,b2,A.b(["High-quality camera scanning","Auto-crop & smart edge detection","PDF creation & compression","OCR text recognition (ML Kit)","Multi-page document support","Image editing (crop, rotate, filters)","Digital signatures & markup tools","Local storage with Hive & Sqflite","Offline functionality","Responsive UI with animations","Localization support","Firebase messaging & crash reporting","Remote Config integration","Google Mobile Ads monetization"],f2),"Softify is a modern and feature-rich document scanning application built with Flutter. It allows users to scan documents, books, receipts, and ID cards with high precision. The app supports auto-enhancement, cropping, filters, OCR text recognition, PDF generation, page management, and image editing tools. With offline support, smooth animations, local storage, Firebase integrations, and Google Ads monetization, Softify delivers a seamless and professional document management experience.",b6,!1,!1,"Developed full scanning workflow, implemented OCR, designed editing tools, integrated PDF generation, built responsive UI, added Firebase services and Google Ads, optimized offline storage and performance.",A.b([e7,"assets/project_mockup/softify_pdf/screen_2.webp","assets/project_mockup/softify_pdf/screen_3.webp","assets/project_mockup/softify_pdf/screen_4.webp","assets/project_mockup/softify_pdf/screen_5.webp","assets/project_mockup/softify_pdf/screen_6.webp","assets/project_mockup/softify_pdf/screen_7.webp"],f2),"Fast and intelligent document scanner with PDF tools, OCR, image editing, and offline support.",a4,e7,"Softify \u2013 PD Cam Scan & Document Manager",b6)
