a7=A.cL(b6,"Robotics",A.b(["Cross-platform support (Android, iOS, Web, Desktop)","ROS (Robot Operating System) integration","Real-time robot communication","Flutter-ROS bridge development","Java backend integration","Multi-platform deployment","Version compatibility management","Bug fixes and performance improvements","Code stability maintenance"],f2),"Worked on a cross-platform app suite (Android, iOS, Web, Desktop) for Robot Operating System (ROS)-based hardware. Fixed bugs, improved performance, and maintained code stability across versions. Contributed to building the Flutter-ROS bridge for real-time robot communication. Integrated Java-based backend services with multi-platform Flutter frontends. Supported multi-module deployment and version compatibility for web and mobile users.",b6,!1,!1,"Fixed bugs across platforms, improved performance, maintained code stability, contributed to Flutter-ROS bridge, supported multi-module deployment.",A.b([],f2),"Flutter \u2022 Java \u2022 ROS \u2022 Cross-platform (Android, iOS, Web, Desktop)",a7,"assets/images/projects/dasher_thumbnail.webp","\ud83e\udd16 Dasher / Odigo \u2013 Robotics Companion App",b6)
